card c12
kind: teach
type: explain
tier: deeper
scored: 0
title: Go deeper: shields at work
figure: shields-in-use
figure_at: 1

body:
    Barriers of lead, concrete or water protect against gamma rays and X-rays. That is why some radioactive materials are stored under water, or in concrete or lead-lined rooms, and why a dentist puts a lead apron on you.
